---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import workbench from '@images/theme/embedded-workbench.png'
---
<section class="home-hero">
    <Image class="hero-background" src={workbench} alt="暖色灯光下的嵌入式开发工作台" width={1672} height={941} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="hero-shade"></div>
    <div class="container hero-content">
        <p class="handwritten hero-kicker">代码 · 技术 · 真实世界</p>
        <h1>记录代码，<br />连接<span>现实。</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-description">你好，我是 Yongjian Peng。<br />在这里记录技术学习、代码实践与开发中的思考。<br class="desktop-break" />从工具到系统，让每一次探索<br class="desktop-break" />都留下有用的笔记。</p>
        <div class="hero-buttons"><a class="button primary" href="/posts/">阅读文章 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/posts/gblog/">关于博客 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
</section>
